# UP District Mapper Skill

Produces three types of outputs from a single conversation:
1. **Interactive HTML map** — D3 + TopoJSON choropleth of all 75 UP districts
2. **Excel workbook** — district summary, municipal bodies, division rollup, block lat/lon
3. **Distance & travel-time sheet** — haversine + road factor from one origin to many block HQs

---

## Workflow overview

```
User provides origin + block list
        │
        ▼
1. Parse inputs (coordinates / named location)
2. Compute haversine distances
3. Apply road sinuosity factor (×1.3 for UP)
4. Compute travel time (÷ 40 km/h)
5. Build styled .xlsx with one tab
6. Recalculate formulas via recalc script
7. present_files() to user
```

