## Excel sheet structure (distance output)

### Columns (A–J)
| Col | Header | Notes |
|-----|--------|-------|
| A | # | Sequential row number |
| B | Block HQ | Block name |
| C | District | Colour-banded by district |
| D | Division | Colour-banded by district |
| E | Latitude | 4 decimal places `0.0000` |
| F | Longitude | 4 decimal places `0.0000` |
| G | Straight-line (km) | Haversine result, format `0.0` |
| H | Est. Road Dist. (km) | `G × 1.3`, format `0.0` |
| I | Est. Travel Time | Colour-coded (green/amber/red) |
| J | Route in Maps | `HYPERLINK` formula to Google Maps directions |

