## Common mistakes to avoid

| Mistake | Correct approach |
|---------|-----------------|
| Assigning blocks to wrong district after 2008/2011 reorganisation | Etah blocks → Kasganj; Moradabad blocks → Sambhal |
| Duplicate block entries with spelling variants | Deduplicate before writing; one canonical spelling only |
| Blocks from a newly carved district still listed under parent | Always use post-2011 district boundaries |
| Using `localStorage` in HTML artifacts | Use in-memory JS state only |
| Sheet name with `/` in openpyxl | Use `&` or `-` instead |
| Fetching CDN URLs not previously seen in conversation | Pre-approved: `cdnjs.cloudflare.com`, `cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/guneetnarula/…` |

